WEBVTT

00:08.100 --> 00:11.040
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

00:11.670 --> 00:14.610
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

00:15.280 --> 00:18.250
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

00:18.880 --> 00:21.610
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

00:22.390 --> 00:25.450
Mekurumeku koshitsuki MUCHO

00:26.020 --> 00:29.010
Kodomo nya kiwadoi AMIGO

00:29.590 --> 00:32.720
Kisu shitara suikomaresou

00:33.330 --> 00:35.730
Kowai mono mitasa TONIGHT

00:36.830 --> 00:38.700
Ojikeduitara dame

00:38.700 --> 00:40.500
Oshite osarete GOING

00:40.500 --> 00:42.340
Dokkiri kibun ga iine

00:42.340 --> 00:43.940
Chakkari asa made DANCING

00:43.940 --> 00:45.930
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:46.010 --> 00:49.380
TROPICANA

00:51.280 --> 00:54.220
Yashi no kokage de tsukamaete

00:54.850 --> 00:58.010
Jirashite tokoton tokoton

00:58.660 --> 01:01.520
Gomen ne anata wa mou toriko

01:02.160 --> 01:05.220
Nigerarenai Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:05.800 --> 01:08.630
Koi seyo shounen shoujo tachi

01:09.330 --> 01:12.390
Kirari hitomi ni hoshi irete

01:13.070 --> 01:15.970
Umareta manma no jounetsu ga

01:16.740 --> 01:18.670
Hibana chirasu Jungle Haré nochi Guu!

01:22.350 --> 01:28.520
Hot~hot~hot~hot~hot~ Hot~!

01:28.860 --> 01:31.030
Hot~hot~hot~hot~hot~

01:31.030 --> 01:32.790
Hot~!

01:34.760 --> 01:36.200
Haré, ice.

01:36.270 --> 01:36.990
There isn't any.

01:39.070 --> 01:40.160
Why's that?

01:40.270 --> 01:42.870
Because you keep using it all, Mom.

01:42.870 --> 01:44.840
The fridge can't keep up.

01:46.710 --> 01:49.580
Then when there is some, bring it to me.

01:49.650 --> 01:52.480
No. If you want it, do it yourself.

01:54.280 --> 01:56.120
Hot~!

01:56.120 --> 01:59.720
Hot~hot~hot~hot~hot~ Hot~!!

01:59.720 --> 02:00.860
Oh, geez!

02:00.860 --> 02:03.290
Quit making such annoying noises!
Can you just shut up for a while!?

02:03.960 --> 02:07.400
But, it's soooooooo hot!

02:08.960 --> 02:10.400
Aren't you hot, Guu?

02:10.570 --> 02:12.030
Can't you tell by looking at my face?

02:12.100 --> 02:13.300
No, I can't.

02:14.370 --> 02:15.570
Hot~!

02:15.570 --> 02:17.370
It's so hot!

02:17.770 --> 02:21.330
It really is too hot lately,
even though this is a jungle.

02:22.540 --> 02:24.010
Hey, how about we buy an air conditioner?

02:24.310 --> 02:26.380
In this room full of holes?

02:26.380 --> 02:28.750
Then, what other choice do we have?

02:29.080 --> 02:30.050
Wait just a minute.

02:30.350 --> 02:31.050
Here.

02:31.690 --> 02:32.880
An encyclopedia?

02:35.090 --> 02:39.030
In the desert, they dress like this to escape
the heat.

02:39.600 --> 02:41.220
Hmmm...

02:41.830 --> 02:42.630
Yeah.

02:45.400 --> 02:51.340
This style is useful to avoid direct sunlight in
the arid deserts.

02:51.610 --> 02:54.580
However, in the humid jungle,
this will have the opposite effect.

02:56.250 --> 02:58.110
I've had enough of this!

02:58.310 --> 03:01.150
I'd be better off drinking beer than doing this!

03:01.220 --> 03:03.240
Mom, are you really going to start drinking
this early in the day?

03:11.230 --> 03:12.720
Great!

03:16.800 --> 03:17.660
Oh...

03:18.370 --> 03:19.430
What's wrong, Mom?

03:19.840 --> 03:21.740
I'm not getting any cooler.

03:22.070 --> 03:25.710
Of course. When it's this hot, it's useless no
matter how much beer you drink.

03:25.710 --> 03:27.640
Then, all you have to do is strip.

03:28.310 --> 03:29.540
That's true!

03:29.610 --> 03:30.130
What!?

03:30.480 --> 03:31.750
Then, I'll go ahead.

03:31.750 --> 03:33.210
Wait! Stop it!

03:33.280 --> 03:34.410
Ta-dah!

03:34.650 --> 03:38.480
Stop it! You're embarrassing me!
Please, wear something!

03:40.190 --> 03:41.950
Oh, Dr. Clive.

03:42.020 --> 03:44.020
H-Hey...

03:45.030 --> 03:48.000
What do you mean, "Hey"! Don't just stare at
my mom's naked body like that!

03:48.260 --> 03:49.430
Is it my fault!?

03:49.430 --> 03:50.260
Doesn't matter!

03:52.030 --> 03:54.370
So, why were you guys
running around like that?

03:54.370 --> 03:56.170
Don't get so close to Mom.

03:56.340 --> 03:57.400
Shut up.

03:57.670 --> 03:58.700
Actually...

03:59.070 --> 04:00.410
...and there you have it.

04:00.480 --> 04:02.000
It's so hot, so hot!

04:03.850 --> 04:05.810
You have something you want to say?

04:05.910 --> 04:07.970
I've got plenty, but it doesn't matter right
now.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.120
Oh really.

04:09.120 --> 04:11.920
Hey, do you have an solutions to suggest?

04:12.220 --> 04:13.950
Would you like to come to the nurse's office?

04:14.090 --> 04:15.780
There's air conditioning in there.

04:15.890 --> 04:16.790
That's true...

04:16.860 --> 04:17.720
We're not going!

04:17.990 --> 04:20.760
If you're so opposed, then suggest an
alternative.

04:21.030 --> 04:21.790
Then...

04:22.600 --> 04:24.500
We should go someplace cooler.

04:25.100 --> 04:26.590
Somewhere cooler?

04:28.500 --> 04:31.300
The highlands are supposedly cool even in
the summer.

04:31.840 --> 04:33.740
The highlands, huh...

04:48.790 --> 04:51.780
The highlands might be nice.

04:51.990 --> 04:52.960
Right, Mom?

04:53.130 --> 04:54.860
And so, how about the beach?

04:54.960 --> 04:56.400
Oh, that sounds good.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.060
What!?

04:57.130 --> 04:58.660
I have to start getting ready now!

04:59.100 --> 05:00.160
Dammit!

05:00.340 --> 05:02.430
How did this conversation
end up at the beach?

05:03.370 --> 05:04.270
If you go to the beach...

05:05.070 --> 05:07.200
You can see Weda in a swimsuit.

05:07.410 --> 05:10.310
What's so fun about seeing your mother in a
swimsuit?

05:14.180 --> 05:14.850
Hey!

05:14.850 --> 05:15.650
Ugh...

05:15.780 --> 05:19.080
Don't tell me you're getting ready to go to the
beach.

05:21.890 --> 05:22.690
Got a problem with that?

05:22.760 --> 05:25.490
Don't be so nonchalant about it just because
you can't think of an excuse!

05:25.930 --> 05:27.230
In the first place,
that's no way to be
talking to your father!

05:27.230 --> 05:29.360
In the first place, I can't hear you...
that's no way to be I can't hear anything!
Talking to your father!

05:29.360 --> 05:32.530
There are proper I won't accept
ways to speak someone who goes
to your elders, to the beach to see
you know!? People in swimsuits
as my father!

05:35.970 --> 05:38.170
Emergency, emergency.

05:38.410 --> 05:40.510
Since it's been hot lately...

05:40.510 --> 05:42.500
...let's all go on a sea-pic!

05:42.740 --> 05:45.710
In Short, Sea-Pic

05:45.950 --> 05:49.690
We'll gather here tomorrow at 8:00AM to
board the bus...

05:49.690 --> 05:52.480
...and go to the beach for a picnic.
Is that okay?

05:55.590 --> 05:55.960
Bye! See you tomorrow!

05:55.960 --> 05:56.690
Since that's been decided,
I have to make lunch!
Bye! See you tomorrow!

05:56.690 --> 05:58.420
Since that's been decided,
I have to make lunch!

05:58.490 --> 05:58.960
Really!?

05:59.230 --> 06:00.220
Mom, you're going to?

06:00.500 --> 06:01.660
What's with that look?

06:01.760 --> 06:02.590
No. It's nothing...

06:02.970 --> 06:05.560
I can make something if
I really put my mind to it!

06:05.870 --> 06:08.430
You can't make anything unless you really
put your mind to it.

06:08.640 --> 06:09.570
Did you say something?

06:09.770 --> 06:10.760
No. It's nothing...

06:10.870 --> 06:11.870
I'm jealous...

06:11.870 --> 06:13.670
A lunch made by your mom...

06:13.910 --> 06:14.740
That's right...

06:14.880 --> 06:16.430
I'll make you one too, Marie.

06:16.510 --> 06:17.640
What? Really?

06:18.780 --> 06:21.550
Making one extra
doesn't increase my effort at all.

06:21.550 --> 06:23.880
But, making even one lunch
is a big ordeal for you.

06:24.550 --> 06:25.950
Enough of your mumbling!

06:25.950 --> 06:27.950
Pheasants don't get shot
if they don't make noise.

06:30.230 --> 06:31.330
All right, let's get to it!

06:31.330 --> 06:32.590
Wait, you're going to make them now?

06:32.690 --> 06:34.560
That way, it'll be easy in the morning!

06:34.660 --> 06:36.320
And, what are you going to make?

06:36.470 --> 06:36.990
Huh?

06:37.830 --> 06:39.660
Let's see...

06:39.870 --> 06:41.860
Um...

06:42.070 --> 06:44.700
Um...

06:44.940 --> 06:45.670
Oh!

06:47.010 --> 06:48.810
The lunch menu will be...

06:49.640 --> 06:51.200
A surprise for tomorrow!

06:52.310 --> 06:54.480
Now, to cook, to cook!

06:54.720 --> 06:55.980
Guu will help.

06:56.050 --> 06:58.950
Oh, then could you fill the pot with water?

06:59.020 --> 06:59.680
Sure.

07:12.300 --> 07:13.460
Here, water.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.970
W-W-W-Wait a minute!

07:17.840 --> 07:20.070
Did you see any problem with that?

07:20.240 --> 07:22.400
Yeah! Of course, I totally saw something!

07:22.510 --> 07:23.270
What?

07:23.380 --> 07:25.910
D-Don't throw up water!

07:25.910 --> 07:26.680
Shut up!

07:27.480 --> 07:28.950
What's that all of a sudden?

07:29.120 --> 07:31.790
Both Guu and I are doing our best!

07:31.790 --> 07:33.480
You keep your mouth shut about this!

07:35.790 --> 07:37.620
So just sit quietly and wait.

07:39.130 --> 07:42.760
U-Um... I don't recall having a door right
there in our house.

07:44.330 --> 07:47.030
Mom, I'm begging,
don't overexert yourself too much.

07:47.300 --> 07:48.670
I know that!

07:48.800 --> 07:51.140
Toh~! Tah~!

07:51.640 --> 07:52.830
Oh, brother...

07:53.610 --> 07:54.510
Ouch!
What in the world
is going to come out of this...

07:54.510 --> 07:54.840
What in the world
is going to come out of this...

07:54.840 --> 07:56.110
Whoa!!
What in the world
is going to come out of this...

08:02.720 --> 08:05.690
I couldn't help but come since I'm so excited
about what she'll make.

08:05.920 --> 08:07.750
You might be
surprised to see what comes out...

08:08.020 --> 08:10.820
I know that Weda is not too good at cooking.

08:11.030 --> 08:16.050
But, I'm just happy that she's doing her best
to do something for me.

08:20.170 --> 08:21.500
Ouch!

08:21.500 --> 08:23.440
Dammit, I won't lose!

08:25.610 --> 08:28.240
Well, you can't expect too much...

08:28.240 --> 08:30.580
but you'll see what kind of lunch it is when
tomorrow comes.

08:36.920 --> 08:38.150
I'll be fine from here.

08:39.590 --> 08:41.750
Then, I'll see you tomorrow at the sea-pic.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.190
See you at the sea-pic.

08:46.030 --> 08:47.290
See ya!

08:53.270 --> 08:54.830
I should go to sleep now...

08:56.670 --> 08:58.340
It's finally done!

08:58.340 --> 09:01.070
Fried chicken, cabbage rolls, and bell
peppers stuffed with meat!

09:01.210 --> 09:03.770
You would think this was made from those
ingredients, would you?

09:03.950 --> 09:04.670
Definitely.

09:05.050 --> 09:07.840
This is all thanks to you helping me out,
Guu-chan.

09:07.920 --> 09:08.640
Don't mention it.

09:09.780 --> 09:13.620
After I accomplish something, I really feel
like having a drink!

09:13.890 --> 09:14.510
Here.

09:15.560 --> 09:19.650
But, if I start drinking now, I might not be
able to get up in the morning...

09:21.660 --> 09:24.460
B-But, I really did my best...

09:24.730 --> 09:26.670
Now, drink to your heart's content.

09:26.900 --> 09:28.370
Then, just one.

09:42.080 --> 09:42.980
What time is it?

09:45.090 --> 09:46.590
Thank goodness.

09:46.590 --> 09:48.460
What perfect timing.

09:48.460 --> 09:48.980
Oh?

09:53.430 --> 09:54.260
What's this!?

09:54.360 --> 09:56.330
It turned into beer snacks and disappeared.

09:56.630 --> 09:57.390
Oh no!

10:00.700 --> 10:01.690
Good morning.

10:01.800 --> 10:02.290
Here.

10:02.370 --> 10:03.000
Huh?

10:03.440 --> 10:04.310
Your lunch...

10:04.310 --> 10:06.570
Though I'm not sure if you'll like it or not.

10:07.910 --> 10:10.210
There's no way I wouldn't like it!

10:10.380 --> 10:11.440
Thanks, Mom.

10:11.550 --> 10:12.410
All right.

10:12.610 --> 10:13.710
And so...

10:13.780 --> 10:15.980
Let's head out to the beach!

10:17.020 --> 10:19.390
The beach! The beach! The beach...

10:19.390 --> 10:21.580
Now it's getting very lively inside the bus!

10:21.660 --> 10:24.450
Marie is so happy to get a lunch from Mom.

10:24.530 --> 10:26.820
It's such a lovely sight to see!

10:26.930 --> 10:29.800
On a side note,
the happiest one here seems to be him.

10:30.800 --> 10:33.060
Oh my, this guy is getting quite lively too.

10:33.300 --> 10:35.030
What a sickening sight.

10:35.440 --> 10:38.130
Clive's parka
is the same design as yours, Haré.

10:38.210 --> 10:40.440
This is my only resort outfit.

10:40.680 --> 10:42.880
Let's take a look at the seat next to Weda.

10:42.880 --> 10:43.500
Huh?

10:44.980 --> 10:48.280
Uighur somehow
found a seat right next to Weda...

10:48.350 --> 10:50.080
...but he seems to be awfully carsick.

10:50.690 --> 10:53.420
The vomit bag he's holding does inspire
some pity.

10:53.490 --> 10:56.580
Something must be welling up inside him.

10:58.160 --> 10:59.060
Next please.

10:59.190 --> 11:01.990
What was the purpose
of this guy coming along?

11:02.260 --> 11:05.290
Next, Elder is the driver
and Gupta is the navigator.

11:05.470 --> 11:07.330
When do you think we'll arrive at the beach?

11:07.570 --> 11:09.330
It will take four days.

11:09.400 --> 11:10.370
No it won't.

11:13.110 --> 11:14.670
Hey, everyone, it's the beach!

11:15.010 --> 11:16.030
Wow!

11:16.180 --> 11:17.340
It's the beach!

11:18.150 --> 11:19.010
All right!

11:19.010 --> 11:20.980
Today I'm going to swim with all my might!

11:21.850 --> 11:22.650
Mom.

11:22.980 --> 11:25.010
None of that sexy swimsuit stuff! Got that?

11:25.120 --> 11:25.780
Tch!

11:36.400 --> 11:38.870
All right, all of you are free to do whatever!

11:40.270 --> 11:43.860
Hey! Make sure to stretch before swimming!

11:45.070 --> 11:46.370
Everyone is so energetic...

11:46.810 --> 11:48.280
Hurry, Mom!

11:48.910 --> 11:49.930
Sure!

11:50.450 --> 11:51.670
What's with that swimsuit!?

11:52.250 --> 11:53.110
Isn't it nice?

11:53.110 --> 11:54.080
Nice! Nice!

11:54.320 --> 11:56.250
I told you, no sexy swimsuits!

11:56.320 --> 11:59.340
This isn't a sexy one. This is a cute one.

11:59.420 --> 12:00.290
Right?

12:00.360 --> 12:02.050
How are you telling the difference?

12:02.390 --> 12:04.520
Oh, aren't you going to swim, doctor?

12:04.630 --> 12:07.860
Well, my skin doesn't
do too good with direct sunlight...

12:07.930 --> 12:09.860
That's enough, take it off!

12:10.670 --> 12:12.130
Mom, that's sexual harassment...

12:12.230 --> 12:12.790
Here!

12:13.100 --> 12:13.530
Okay!

12:13.600 --> 12:14.330
There!

12:14.840 --> 12:17.170
I heard that there are mantas at this beach.

12:24.750 --> 12:26.840
Now, let's swim!

12:26.920 --> 12:27.780
Hey, you!

12:28.580 --> 12:29.380
You alone?

12:29.380 --> 12:30.370
You want to swim together?

12:33.050 --> 12:34.720
I'm sorry!

12:34.790 --> 12:36.420
Oh man, she's got a kid.

12:36.490 --> 12:37.890
I've got a kid!?

12:37.960 --> 12:40.390
Do I look like I have such an old child!?

12:40.560 --> 12:43.290
If you say something so stupid,
I'll punch you!

12:43.400 --> 12:44.590
You've already punched him.

12:45.970 --> 12:50.530
Geez, why do all the "players" hang out at
the beach?

12:50.710 --> 12:52.300
That's obvious.

12:53.610 --> 12:54.770
They're looking for an opportunity.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.000
A-Adults!

12:57.650 --> 12:59.410
Yipee! Lunch!

12:59.780 --> 13:01.150
Weda, aren't you going to eat?

13:02.280 --> 13:04.950
I have to go talk to Rebecca.

13:06.650 --> 13:07.990
Thanks, Mom.

13:08.690 --> 13:09.710
Then, let's eat.

13:10.430 --> 13:11.360
Right!

13:13.230 --> 13:14.960
I wonder what kind of lunch this is!

13:15.500 --> 13:16.930
Time to eat!

13:18.870 --> 13:19.460
Wha...!?

13:21.500 --> 13:22.270
You want one?

13:22.340 --> 13:23.930
Oh, excuse me.

13:24.010 --> 13:25.870
What's with that lunch!?

13:27.080 --> 13:28.670
I didn't have much time.

13:28.740 --> 13:30.800
You had from last night to this morning!!

13:31.350 --> 13:32.370
Haré!

13:33.420 --> 13:35.280
Let's hurry up and eat
so we can go swimming.

13:35.280 --> 13:37.380
It's simple and really tasty!

13:37.990 --> 13:39.540
Simple, huh...

13:43.730 --> 13:44.780
Haré!

13:46.430 --> 13:47.290
What's wrong?

13:47.630 --> 13:48.990
I felt a prick on my foot.

13:49.060 --> 13:51.260
Oh, that's just a fish biting.

13:51.330 --> 13:52.230
It happens often.

13:58.070 --> 13:59.770
I see... He's right.

13:59.770 --> 14:01.240
There are quite a few...

14:11.390 --> 14:12.150
What's wrong?

14:12.390 --> 14:13.750
Did a fish bite you?

14:13.860 --> 14:15.760
I-I think it tried to swallow me.

14:15.760 --> 14:16.720
Swallow you?

14:16.790 --> 14:19.280
There aren't any fish that big around here.

14:20.760 --> 14:22.460
Geez! What are you doing?

14:22.860 --> 14:24.230
My mistake.

14:24.430 --> 14:25.960
No use being cutesy about it.

14:26.070 --> 14:28.040
Don't treat fish and humans
as if they were the same!

14:28.600 --> 14:29.870
So demanding...

14:30.070 --> 14:31.440
What do you mean "demanding!?"

14:31.440 --> 14:33.370
I'm the one who feels
irritated because of this!

14:33.910 --> 14:35.240
Oh, Haré.

14:35.380 --> 14:36.430
Mom?

14:36.540 --> 14:38.030
What's with this?

14:38.250 --> 14:39.340
I borrowed it.

14:39.410 --> 14:41.250
I thought about taking a nap on this.

14:41.350 --> 14:41.970
You want to join me?

14:42.050 --> 14:42.680
Sure.

14:51.060 --> 14:53.220
This feels so good...

15:09.240 --> 15:10.840
I slept for quite a while.

15:24.390 --> 15:26.190
N-No way!

15:29.760 --> 15:31.250
Adrift?

15:34.870 --> 15:36.600
I slept so well!

15:36.600 --> 15:39.510
There's nothing like taking a nap under the
sun!

15:39.840 --> 15:41.780
On top of it, the sky is a clear blue!

15:41.940 --> 15:44.310
And, the blue sea
stretches out as far as I can see!

15:44.410 --> 15:45.810
On top of that, a blue face.

15:45.810 --> 15:46.440
Hm?

15:47.080 --> 15:47.950
What's wrong?

15:48.250 --> 15:49.940
You'll get angry if I tell you.

15:50.020 --> 15:50.850
Huh?

15:50.850 --> 15:53.290
What is it? I won't get mad, so tell me.

15:59.430 --> 16:00.160
We...

16:00.900 --> 16:02.520
...seem to have gotten lost.

16:03.530 --> 16:04.050
Huh?

16:31.560 --> 16:32.360
Um...

16:32.360 --> 16:33.550
What is this!?

16:33.630 --> 16:35.400
See, you got angry after all!

16:35.400 --> 16:36.920
That's not the problem here!

16:37.070 --> 16:39.300
Why didn't you tell me sooner?

16:39.430 --> 16:40.800
You should have woken me up!

16:40.970 --> 16:42.770
I tried to wake you up long ago!!

16:42.770 --> 16:44.010
But, you, Mom!

16:44.010 --> 16:45.400
Mom! Mom!

16:45.470 --> 16:47.910
We're got a huge problem! Come on!

16:48.310 --> 16:50.210
I'm still sleepy. Don't wake me up.

16:50.280 --> 16:53.210
You were all too ready to kill me!

16:55.720 --> 16:58.950
So we're lost, huh?
This is a problem. What should we do?

16:59.220 --> 17:00.690
Don't change the subject.

17:00.860 --> 17:03.690
Well, there's nothing to be gained from
making a scene about this.

17:03.760 --> 17:04.250
What?

17:04.390 --> 17:06.330
If we wait, someone will come rescue us.

17:06.390 --> 17:07.450
Y-You think so?

17:07.560 --> 17:08.650
They'll come, they'll come.

17:08.760 --> 17:11.060
I'm sure everyone is starting to look for us
right about now.

17:11.630 --> 17:13.970
T-That's true, you're right.

17:14.540 --> 17:17.900
Mom's optimism is a welcome relief at times
like this.

17:18.640 --> 17:19.730
And so...

17:19.840 --> 17:21.210
I'm going back to sleep.

17:21.380 --> 17:21.930
What!?

17:22.010 --> 17:22.980
Good night!

17:23.140 --> 17:24.200
Oh, wait...

17:26.250 --> 17:30.010
She may be optimistic, but I think this is
taking it a bit too far.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.790
I'm getting thirsty, too...

17:36.060 --> 17:40.930
If we don't get rescued soon, I don't know
what dangers we're likely to face.

17:48.600 --> 17:50.260
T-That was...

18:04.350 --> 18:06.050
It's no time to be passing out.

18:06.050 --> 18:07.420
W-W-What should I do?

18:07.420 --> 18:09.420
I-I-Is it better to wake up Mom?

18:09.420 --> 18:11.150
But, even if I wake her up...

18:14.300 --> 18:16.530
Guu, help me!

18:18.570 --> 18:19.590
What is it?

18:20.700 --> 18:22.360
How long have you been here?

18:22.970 --> 18:25.470
Since you passed out with a goofy face...

18:25.470 --> 18:28.880
...then panicked and freaked out with snot
dripping from your nose.

18:28.880 --> 18:32.330
Okay, okay, I don't need to hear all the
details.

18:32.480 --> 18:34.970
Just help me!

18:36.750 --> 18:38.450
If it's okay for me to swallow...

18:43.260 --> 18:45.990
Um, won't that put Seiichi and the gang in
danger?

18:46.630 --> 18:47.720
Different stomach.

18:50.500 --> 18:53.730
Although I'm the one that asked her, I wonder
if this will be all right.

18:54.370 --> 18:58.100
Even for Guu, won't it be dangerous to
swallow a shark?

19:00.370 --> 19:02.040
But still...

19:02.780 --> 19:04.370
It's so quiet...

19:46.620 --> 19:48.050
The ocean...

19:50.890 --> 19:52.380
What's going on?

19:52.890 --> 19:53.990
This is...

19:55.600 --> 19:57.430
What's going on here!?

20:23.790 --> 20:24.280
Ouch.

20:24.830 --> 20:25.850
Haré!

20:25.930 --> 20:26.990
Weda!

20:27.060 --> 20:28.030
Haré!

20:28.030 --> 20:29.360
Weda!

20:29.430 --> 20:30.260
Over there!

20:32.000 --> 20:33.190
He nearly drowned.

20:33.670 --> 20:34.500
Weda!

20:37.740 --> 20:38.970
Out of the way, amateur.

20:43.980 --> 20:44.640
Hm.

20:46.680 --> 20:48.550
I'll take care of Haré.

20:49.120 --> 20:49.810
Please do.

20:52.990 --> 20:54.980
Guooo~!

20:56.760 --> 20:58.590
Weda's breathing again.

20:59.190 --> 21:01.160
Oh, Haré came to as well!

21:02.200 --> 21:02.890
Damn.

21:03.030 --> 21:05.020
Oh, that was fun!

21:05.200 --> 21:08.640
It's amazing that she can think she had fun
after being in such a situation...

21:08.800 --> 21:10.400
Let's come to the beach again!

21:10.640 --> 21:11.500
Of course.

21:11.810 --> 21:15.240
I don't want to come to the beach with this
gang ever again!

21:15.710 --> 21:17.840
All right, is everyone on board?

21:17.910 --> 21:18.740
Yeah!

21:18.810 --> 21:20.410
Let's go!

